@startuml "Gestion des remboursements - Organisateur"

title Traitement des remboursements

actor "Organisateur" as Organizer
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Auth Middleware" as Auth
participant "Order Controller" as OrderCtrl
participant "Payment Service" as PaymentSvc
participant "Notification Service" as NotifSvc
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
participant "Stripe" as Stripe

== Gestion des remboursements ==
Organizer -> Frontend: Traiter remboursement
Frontend -> API: POST /api/orders/{orderId}/refund
note right: Body: {reason, amount}
API -> Auth: Vérifier propriété via événement
Auth -> DB: SELECT order WITH event WHERE order.id=? AND event.organizerId=?
DB --> Auth: access granted

API -> OrderCtrl: processRefund(orderId, refundData)
OrderCtrl -> PaymentSvc: createRefund(orderId, amount, reason)
PaymentSvc -> DB: SELECT payment WHERE orderId=?
DB --> PaymentSvc: payment data

PaymentSvc -> Stripe: Create refund
note right: {payment_intent, amount, reason}
Stripe --> PaymentSvc: refund created

PaymentSvc -> DB: UPDATE payment SET refundedAmount=?, refundedAt=NOW()
PaymentSvc -> DB: UPDATE order SET status='refunded'
PaymentSvc -> DB: UPDATE tickets SET status='cancelled' WHERE orderId=?
DB --> PaymentSvc: refund processed

PaymentSvc -> NotifSvc: notifyRefund(userId, orderId, amount)
NotifSvc -> NotifSvc: sendRefundNotification(user, refund)

PaymentSvc --> OrderCtrl: refund success
OrderCtrl --> API: refund processed
API --> Frontend: refund successful
Frontend --> Organizer: "Remboursement traité"

@enduml